 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjfdr10MjbUQ7kNvwFO-mff&_nc_oc=AdrJDt6GVuib1ROXjuGZE5jFDpkxYUWKwcOUgBiUnLur5OlAWKczaYb_5V0Kr-Z6hPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPpfMCVyYpmzbj4zoYpqSMZgD7Xk4jVKBTEoPp--2OxyQ&oe=6AC662C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KvwF9nhSnS0Q7kNvwHwq-cW&_nc_oc=AdriU1IX5iQZhxk19xl0CMQ3mygrOkPsLveTqnvhzS_dDffTp4NVVT_JL00MdRpLjDs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOI2vqjrCTYgvnTyaMlL9wazOHAZn60NK5HGrb-IU3vPA&oe=6AC67026"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RwwQ9TQargEQ7kNvwH3HOTv&_nc_oc=Adp0yhEOPdvNAbAOJAQygvtXBP_XzmT7LQXzRhieG-_yDCGYhlYR8zAKMjhCRaMxEIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMbBWg0lsKRXqvrw1R9rLuc5p7EVdqg_qx-Hlm688o_lw&oe=6AC641DC"}, {"fil